  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Apoyo a la Reforma de Empresas Pblicas</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">State-Owned Enterprise Reform Support Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general es reducir la carga fiscal para el Estado derivada de la propiedad de Empresas Pblicas (EEPP). Los objetivos especficos son: (i) incrementar el nmero de EEPP alineadas a los principios de gobernanza corporativa de la Organizacin para la Cooperacin y el Desarrollo Econmicos; incluyendo una gobernanza fiscal anloga a la del sector privado; y (ii) aumentar la eficiencia de las EEPP de los sectores de hidrocarburos, elctrico y aeronutico.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective is to reduce the tax burden on the State arising from its ownership of State-owned enterprises (SOEs). The specific objectives are to: (i) increase the number of SOEs that adhere to the corporate governance principles of the Organisation for Economic Co-operation and Development (OECD), including fiscal governance comparable to that of the private sector; and (ii) increase the efficiency of SOEs in the oil and gas, electricity, and aviation sectors.</narrative>
  </description>
